<title>UK: Caradon yr profits at top end of forecasts.</title>
<headline>Caradon yr profits at top end of forecasts.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		16.4		   vs 9.2</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 6.6		    vs 6.6</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 9.5		    vs 9.5</p>
<p> Pretax pre-except	178.2		  vs 114.3</p>
<p> Turnover		   2.11 billion	 vs 2.09 billion</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 168 and 180 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Caradon Plc</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 5427717.</p>
</text>
